# .env.example — key NAMES only, no values. Safe to commit.
#
# Copy this to `.env` (which git ignores) and paste your real key after each `=`.
# NEVER put a real value in THIS file. Format is NAME=value with no spaces around `=`.
#
# Gaaner Sathi needs no keys yet: it is a static, local-first app with no server and
# no paid APIs. Add a name here only when a real need appears, so nobody (human or
# agent) infers a dependency the project does not have. Deploy tokens for CI belong
# in the GitHub repository's secret store, not here.
